[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Test Description - IRONAIR Phase Gates
UID: DOC-TD001
VERSION: 1.0.0
OPTIONS:
  MARKUP: Text

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-TD-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Package import test
STATEMENT: >>>
Import ironair and the public subpackages listed in IA-SYS-001.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
No ImportError. __version__ is a nonempty string.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-SYS-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-TD-002
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Constants immutability test
STATEMENT: >>>
Read F_C_MOL, R_J_MOL_K, T_REF_K, P_REF_PA, M_FE_KG_MOL, M_O2_KG_MOL, M_H2O_KG_MOL,
and M_KOH_KG_MOL. Attempting assignment shall fail.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Values match documented CODATA/IUPAC constants. Frozen assignment raises.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-CON-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-TD-003
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Elemental conservation test
STATEMENT: >>>
For each column of S, compute the elemental residual E @ S[:, j].
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Absolute residual < 1e-12 for Fe, O, H, K, and C.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-TST-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-TD-004
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Butler-Volmer equilibrium test
STATEMENT: >>>
Evaluate electrode current at zero overpotential with finite activities.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Net Faradaic current is ~0. Symmetric coefficients produce an odd i(eta) function.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-CHM-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-TD-005
STATUS: Active
TITLE: RHS determinism test
STATEMENT: >>>
Evaluate rhs twice with identical arguments.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Arrays compare equal. Component parameter values are unchanged.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-ODE-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IA-TD-006
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Traceability test
STATEMENT: >>>
Parse reqs/**/*.sdoc UIDs and src/**/*.py @relation markers.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Every @relation UID exists. Every implementation requirement listed in the
traceability map has a function marker.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: IA-REQ-004
